&= u^3 - \frac{3}{2} u^2 \left(-\frac{b}{3a}\right) + \frac{1}{4}u\left(-\frac{b}{3a}\right)^2(3a-2)(3a+2) \\
&= u^3 + \frac{3ab}{2a}u^2 + \frac{1}{4}(-b^3)(3a-2)(3a+2)
\end{align*}

Now, substitute this expression for $x^3$ back into our original equation:

