So, our smallest possible choice of $a_1, a_2, a_3, b_1, b_2$ satisfying the previous conditions is:

\begin{alignat*}{2}
a_1 &= 0 \text{,} & a_2 &= 4 \text{,} \\
a_3 &= 4 \text{,} & b_1 &= 2 \text{,} \\
b_2 &= 5 \text{,} & LHS &= 144^2 + 8^2 + 8^2 + 5^3 \\
